  "description": "CRC and 8-bit checksum calculation, frame encoding, error detection and payload decoding for byte sequences through a common ErrorDetection API.\nSupports CRC8 Classic/Maxim, CRC16 Classic/Modbus/CCITT XModem/DNP/CCITT-FALSE/X25, CRC32 Classic, CRC32C (Castagnoli), CRC64/NVME, and XOR/NMEA, modulo-256 and two's-complement checksums.\nIncludes incremental accumulators and synchronous/asynchronous stream CRC calculation with a reusable 64 KiB buffer. Targets .NET Standard 2.1. See the package README for examples and byte-order behavior.",
  "id": "Mythosia.Integrity",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-14T17:36:16.23Z",
