  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0\n- Add incremental accumulators and synchronous/asynchronous streaming for CRC8, CRC16 and CRC32, with cancellation support and a reusable 64 KiB buffer.\n- Add CRC32C (Castagnoli), CRC64/NVME and CRC16 CCITT-FALSE/X25 across calculation, frame, accumulator and stream APIs.\n- Preserve all existing public API declarations, optional defaults, calculation results, native digest byte order and legacy DNP representation.\n- Validate 175 published fixed answers for the new algorithms within 2,179 Integrity tests, plus independent calculations, partitions, streams and compatibility checks.\n- Verify actual NuGet packages, all eight executable README examples, public API and metadata in Windows/Linux Debug/Release CI; publish only the exact package that passes all four configurations.\nFull release notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia/blob/master/Mythosia.Integrity/RELEASE_NOTES.md",
